Third-party data: kanji stroke order
-------------------------------------

The kanji stroke order data in js/data.js (each stroke's start/end points
and path) was authored and verified against KanjiVG
(https://github.com/KanjiVG/kanjivg), Copyright (C) 2009-2011 Ulrich Apel,
licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-Share Alike 3.0 license
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/).

If you reuse or adapt that stroke data, you must credit KanjiVG and license
your adaptation under the same or a compatible license, per the terms of
CC BY-SA 3.0. This requirement applies only to the stroke order data itself,
not to the rest of this project's code, which is available under the MIT
license above.
